{
  "family": "reload",
  "description": "Re-loading something that was deleted (George, 2026-09-18): by id the tombstone is the target and is terminal — the batch fails closed and the tombstone is untouched; by ref the search sees live rows only, so a node is minted afresh and an edge is refused when its endpoint is a tombstone (Issue# 609 - tap, ruled and landed in PR# 624 - tap: no live edge may point at a tombstone). Nodes, edges, an edge whose own id is a tombstone, and children retired by cascade.",
  "scenarios": [
    {
      "name": "a deleted node re-sent by id fails its batch, sibling included; the tombstone is untouched",
      "tags": [],
      "covers": [
        "req-grid-import-grift-batch",
        "req-grid-service-delete-tombstone",
        "req-grid-import-grift-results-1"
      ],
      "grid": {
        "nodes": [
          {
            "name": "A",
            "type": "grid_fixtures__node",
            "props": {
              "name": "A"
            }
          }
        ],
        "edges": [],
        "tombstoned": [
          "A"
        ]
      },
      "imports": [
        {
          "batches": [
            {
              "name": "b1",
              "nodes": [
                {
                  "id": "A",
                  "type": "grid_fixtures__node",
                  "props": {
                    "name": "A, observed again"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "Y",
                  "type": "grid_fixtures__node",
                  "props": {
                    "name": "Y"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "expected": {
        "imports": [
          {
            "success": false,
            "batches": {
              "b1": "failed"
            },
            "errors": [
              {
                "code": "execution_failed",
                "path": "$.batches[0].nodes[0]"
              }
            ],
            "counts": {
              "b1": {
                "nodes": 0,
                "edges": 0
              }
            }
          }
        ],
        "live": {},
        "tombstoned": {
          "A": 2
        },
        "absent": [
          "Y"
        ],
        "events": {
          "A": {
            "update": 0
          }
        },
        "note": "By id the tombstone is the target and it is terminal (entity_tombstoned under execution_failed): the batch fails closed, Y is not written, A keeps version 2, its content and no new event."
      }
    },
